    56|// ─── Transition Rules ─────────────────────────────────────────────
    57|
    58|/**
    59| * Allowed forward transitions. Each status may only advance to its
    60| * explicitly listed next stages. This enforces the rules:
    61| *   - Discovered is not contacted.
    62| *   - Contacted is not interested.
    63| *   - Interested is not qualified.
    64| *   - Qualified is not committed.
    65| *   - Committed is not funded.
