     2| * IVX IA Reliability Gate — Single Decision Engine.
     3| *
     4| * Problem (owner spec): IVX IA sometimes returns contradictory messages in the
     5| * same conversation — "Task completed" + "Task blocked" + "I'll inspect now" +
     6| * "Open Developer Workspace" — which destroys trust.
     7| *
     8| * FINAL SMALL FIX — IVX TASK STATUS CONTRADICTION (2026-07-19):
     9| * The previous text-based contradiction detector scanned the natural-language
    10| * answer for words like "done", "completed", "blocked", "failed", etc. That
    11| * produced false positives on honest execution answers such as
    12| * "NO CODE CHANGED — no development was completed." when the structured job
    13| * status was BLOCKED. The fix makes the gate read ONE authoritative structured
    14| * status from the persistent worker job whenever it is available, and only
    15| * falls back to text scanning when no structured job is provided.
    16| *
    17| * This gate now enforces five owner-required rules, deterministically and with
    18| * no I/O:
    19| *
    20| *  1. SINGLE DECISION ENGINE — every reply carries exactly ONE status, picked
    21| *     from a fixed state machine: READY | RUNNING | WAITING_OWNER | BLOCKED |
    22| *     FAILED | VERIFIED. Never mixed.
    23| *  2. AUTHORITATIVE STRUCTURED STATUS — when a worker job is provided, the
    24| *     final status is read ONLY from job.status. Natural-language words inside
    25| *     the answer, previous messages, quoted text, logs, or error descriptions
    26| *     do NOT determine the status.
    27| *  3. NO GENERIC PROMISES — "I'll inspect now", "I'll fix it", "One moment",
    28| *     "hold on", "let me check" are blocked unless the answer also carries real
    29| *     evidence (a task id, files changed, commit SHA, deploy id, or live
    30| *     verification). A promise without evidence is rewritten to UNVERIFIED.
    31| *  4. EVIDENCE-FIRST — any claim of Done / Fixed / Verified / Deployed must be
    32| *     backed by evidence fields (Task ID, Files changed, Commit SHA, Render
    33| *     Deploy ID, Live verification). Missing evidence → answer becomes
    34| *     "UNVERIFIED" with the exact missing artifact named.
    35| *  5. STRUCTURED VALIDATION — a completed job must not carry a blockedReason.
    36| *     A blocked job may list completedSteps. A completed code-change task must
    37| *     have filesChanged. Evidence must belong to the same taskId.
    38| *
    39| * Pure + deterministic (no network, filesystem, or AI) so it is fully
    40| * unit-testable. It runs AFTER the senior-developer / access-status / execution
    41| * gates so it never re-implements their work — it only polishes the final answer
    42| * into a single-state, evidence-first reply.
